[N 27-28 Duskwood: Sven and the Hermit]
[D Forever Warrior 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Darkshire hand-ins and Stalvan, then the Sven and Hermit chains walked together in four trips west, plus the Night Watch and Worgen finales. About 39,000 quest XP.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel 27|r  -  you fly into Darkshire with Messenger to Darkshire (145), Crime and Punishment (377) and The Legend of Stalvan (78) in the log, ready to hand in. Hearth = Sentinel Hill and it stays there - nothing in this chapter needs it. About 39,000 quest XP, a little over a level: expect to ding 28 on the third trip west.
[OC]|cffffcc00The shape of the chapter:|r the Sven chain and the Hermit chain each bounce between Darkshire and the west side (Abercrombie 28,31 - Sven 8,34 - Raven Hill 18,56). One after the other they cost seven round trips; interleaved, four: (1) Abercrombie, Sven, the dirt mound; (2) Abercrombie and Sven again; (3) Raven Hill, Sven, the cemetery ghouls, the ogre crate; (4) Eliza. A run is ~3 minutes each way and Sven's camp has no flight path, so a step that waits for your next pass through town is on purpose.

