[OC]|cffffffffTrip 4 west: Eliza|r  -  a short run (~46 units each way) for 3,650 XP
[OC]|cFFFF0000GROUP 2+|r |cffffcc00Eliza|r is a level 31 elite, ~2,310 HP in the Classic DB. Classic sources: she is raised by clicking Eliza's Grave Dirt behind Abercrombie's shack (the repeatable sub-quest Digging Through the Dirt, 254, no XP listed), throws burning lanterns that leave fire on the ground and calls a guard for 20 seconds - unverified on Forever. With a healer it is easy: Defensive Stance, Shield Block, Taunt the guard off the healer, and drag her out of the fire. Not worth dying for: skip it and abandon the quest if it goes badly
